Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's because\Nof them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If they had done\Ntheir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,job properly, I\Nwon't be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,needing to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple, we Indians\Nhave not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,done our job\Nproperly, when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,we say Indians, I\Nmean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Indian football\Nclubs,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,whose only\Nresponsibility was\Nto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,build the future and\Nthey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,have just talked\Nabout their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,present.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That means title\Njeetna humne
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,is saal, is saal.
